This product is an independent re-implementation. It contains no source code
copied from the projects below; it references their concepts, and re-implements
the algorithms it borrows in a different runtime (page-side DOM walkers driven
over CDP instead of Node-side HTML regexes). Two exceptions are declared
explicitly and honestly, because "clean-room, concepts only" would no longer be a
true statement after v0.10.0:

  1. Factual data — search-engine URL templates, SERP CSS selectors, and
     human-verification marker patterns (ids / classes / iframe URLs) were taken
     from the search & reading plugins listed below. These are facts about
     third-party web pages, not creative code, but they are attributed here.
  2. Idea-level ports — the page-side algorithms in page-read.js (main-content
     selection order, link-density threshold, paragraph-aware truncation,
     Markdown walker details, stable element refs, captcha triage) are
     independent DOM re-implementations of ideas found in those projects.

Design inspiration — the capability set (agent-driven real browser + live
watch-over panel with human takeover) was pioneered by:

